  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nThis is a turn-based strategy/RPG game set in the stars. In the early stages, you will recruit a team of experts on Earth for exploring a distant alien homeworld, choosing between scientists, mutants, and soldiers. Scour the planet for lost alien technology and uncover the secrets to Earth’s doom.<p></p>\n<p>Confront alien silicon-based lifeform bosses. Collect monster genes for genetic editing, continuously enhancing them! Make them bigger, bigger, and even bigger, until they become colossal titans! Hundreds of recruitable tactical battle units with a standalone tower defense battle mode. Rich storyline: Choose the ending that suits you the most! Embark upon your amazing journey to the stars!</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Freely create an alien exploration team: engineers, scientists, mutant warriors, military personnel…\n</li><li>Start building a base from scratch on an alien planet.\n</li><li>Hundreds of recruitable tactical battle units…\n</li><li>Thousands of different alien creatures.\n</li><li>A variety of alien civilizations: insectoids, silicon-based lifeforms, super organisms, and more.\n</li><li>Factional conflicts: Exploration teams from the USA, China, Europe, and other nations compete for resources.\n</li></ul>\n",
